blend: skip blend_single when the blending region does not fit into the base or the new grid; it
indexed past the end of a row (blend.rs: index out of bounds). The check is duplicated by mistake;
fix-blend-alpha-region-bounds folds both copies into blend_region_fits. Test:
blend_single_region_bounds (crates/jxl-oxide-tests/tests/blend_single_region_bounds.rs).

Upstream: not reported; the code is unchanged at upstream HEAD (c0cc4c7, 2026-08-15).

